## 7. Entry and Exit Criteria

### Proposed Entry Criteria

- Staging environment is available.
- Login URL is confirmed.
- Requirements or approved behavioral rules are available.
- Approved test accounts and roles are provisioned.
- Browser targets and Playwright versions are confirmed.
- Required permissions and test data are available.
- Test cases are reviewed against requirements or approved assumptions.

### Proposed Exit Criteria

- All critical login test cases have been executed.
- No open Critical or High severity defects remain.
- Medium and Low defects are reviewed and explicitly accepted or scheduled.
- Planned browsers are executed for applicable scenarios.
- Requirement coverage and exceptions are documented.
- Defect evidence and test evidence are recorded.
- Remaining risks and open questions are reported.

The pass threshold and defect policy require stakeholder agreement.

